sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant A as Agent
  participant T as Tool
  participant S as Store
  U->>A: prompt
  loop each round
    A->>T: call(args)
    T-->>A: result
  end
  alt validation passes
    A->>S: append(entry)
    S-->>A: ok
    A-->>U: final reply
  else validation fails
    A->>A: surface_error round
    A-->>U: corrected block
  end
